    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">convecto</span></b> , āre, v.
			freq. a.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to bear, carry</i>, or <i>bring together in
				abundance</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">recentes praedas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 749</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praedam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 405</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ligones, dolabras, etc., e proximis agris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					3, 27</span></i>
			: paleas, ligna, Cod. Th. 7, 4, 9; 13, 5, 10. 
			</div>
